  "name": "Cosmic Eclipse Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Cosmic Eclipse prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 19–20 and 26–27 October 2019, and later sold in shops. Each box held four Cosmic Eclipse booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Cosmic Eclipse logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Sawsbuck, Dusknoir and Rosa, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
